### 1. Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

### 2. List seeded requests
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/requests

### 3. Search
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/requests?q=монитор

### 4. Filter by status
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/requests?status_id=1

### 5. Filter by category and priority
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/requests?category_id=1&priority=high

### 6. Get one
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/requests/1

### 7. Users
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/users

### 8. Statuses
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/statuses

### 9. Categories
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/categories

### 10. Create
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Проблема входа","description":"Не открывается рабочий портал.","category_id":2,"requester_id":1,"priority":"normal"}

### 11. Update priority
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/requests/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"priority":"high","description":"Обновлено: экран остаётся чёрным."}

### 12. Change status (seeded request 1 is New; status 2 is In progress)
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/requests/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"status_id":2,"actor_id":2}

### 13. Validation error example
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"x","description":"bad","category_id":1,"requester_id":1}

### 14. Not found example
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/requests/999999
